<LANGUAGE>
    <CATEGORY Name="Voices_01_02_upsilon_inside">
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_001_Catherine_001">What is... what&apos;s happening? Hello, anyone there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_002_Player_001">Hey, can you hear me?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_003_Catherine_001">I hear you... Upsilon. What&apos;s going on?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_004_Player_001">I have no idea. I just sort of woke up here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_005_Catherine_001">In the room, right now?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_006_Player_001">No, it was like a seat, with a helmet.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_007_Catherine_001">Is that right? What&apos;s your name?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_008_Player_001">Simon Jarret.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_009_Catherine_001">And what do you... Oh no, the signal is - damn relays. Where are you now?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_010_Player_001">Someplace dealing with electrical power, not sure if it&apos;s a plant or a transformer... ring any bells?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_011_Catherine_001">You&apos;re probably in the thermal plant somewhere.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_012_Catherine_001">You want to go upstairs to the comm center. It&apos;s the room with the domed ceiling.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_013_Player_001">Look, this place is not - there&apos;s something seriously wrong here!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomContact_2D_FirstContact_1_014_Catherine_001">Sorry, I didn&apos;t catch that. We lost another relay. Just head for the comm center, upstairs. I&apos;ll wait here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructPlea_2_001_CarlConstruct_001">Who&apos;s there?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructPlea_2_002_CarlConstruct_001">Hey, I can hear you moving.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructPlea_2_003_CarlConstruct_001">I could use some help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructPlea_2_004_CarlConstruct_001">What are you guys doing?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_1_001_Player_001">What are you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_1_002_CarlConstruct_001">Are you blind? It&apos;s me Carl. Carl Semken. Wrangler. Any of this sound familiar to you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_1_003_Player_001">I - no, actually.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_1_004_CarlConstruct_001">Well, thanks for being so helpful. It&apos;s not like I&apos;m knocked out on the floor or anything.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="carlblackbox_4c_carlblackbox_001_carl_001">Did you get the final backup turbos going?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="carlblackbox_4c_carlblackbox_002_amy_001">Everything is wired evenly - we&apos;ve hedged our bets as much as we possibly can.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="carlblackbox_4c_carlblackbox_003_carl_001">So, that&apos;s it. Enough power to run Pathos-2 until the next apocalypse. We&apos;re ready to go.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_4C_CarlBlackBox_004_Amy_001">I really hope we didn&apos;t mess anything up. I don&apos;t want to have to come back here again.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_4C_CarlBlackBox_005_Carl_001">Relax, it&apos;s over. We&apos;re going Theta.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_4C_CarlBlackBox_006_Amy_001">Maybe we should seal more blocks. I don&apos;t trust the helpers to let this place run in peace.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_4C_CarlBlackBox_007_Carl_001">We&apos;ve sealed everything - everything from the barracks to the comm center. If anyone ever sets their foot here again, they&apos;re going to have a hell of a time getting arou...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_4C_CarlBlackBox_008_Amy_001">Carl!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_4C_CarlBlackBox_009_Carl_001">Run.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlBlackBox_SimonReadCarlBlackBox_001_Player_001">What were you doing here?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="amyblackbox_simonreadamyblackbox_001_player_001">WAU, is that a name?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_001_Catherine_001">Much better. Simon was it?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_002_Player_001">Jarret. Simon Jarret.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_003_Catherine_001">Hi Simon, I&apos;m Catherine. Have you figured out what&apos;s going on yet?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_004_Player_001">Me? I was hoping you&apos;d have some answers.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_005_Catherine_001">I probably have some. What do you want to know?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_006_Player_001">Where to even begin. What is this place? How did I get here? And why do the robots talk like they&apos;re people?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_007_Catherine_001">Well, you are at Upsilon, clearly. Have you never been there before? Where did you work?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_008_Player_001">The Grimoire, in Toronto. Is that really important?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_009_Catherine_001">No, I mean. Where did you work at Pathos-2?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_010_Player_001">I don&apos;t know what that is!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_011_Catherine_001">That&apos;s unexpected -- Did you come directly from Toronto?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_012_Player_001">Yes! And it was very unexpected.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_013_Catherine_001">Have you seen any people? Like staff or field technicians?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_1_014_Player_001">Only robots. Crazy ones.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_3_001_Player_001">What was that?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_3_002_Catherine_001">What&apos;s going on?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_3_003_Player_001">I think this place is about to collapse.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomSimonCall_001_Player_001">Hey, are you there? I found the domed ceiling.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_4_001_Catherine_001">Simon!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_4_002_Player_001">What should I do?!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_4_003_Catherine_001">Come to Lambda. There are shuttle trains connecting all the sites -- find one and come here! I&apos;ll wait for you!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonComments_LowerDoorLeverFail_001_Player_001">Doesn&apos;t seem to be powered.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_ControlRoomBodyMoans_001_ControlRoomBody_001">*strained breathing*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_ControlRoomBodyMoans_002_ControlRoomBody_001">*strained breathing*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_ControlRoomBodyMoans_003_ControlRoomBody_001">*strained breathing*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_ControlRoomBodyMoans_004_ControlRoomBody_001">*strained breathing*</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_ControlRoomBodyDies_001_ControlRoomBody_001">I need it!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_ControlRoomBodyDies_002_ControlRoomBody_001">Why? I was okay. I was happy.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4A_CarlIntroductionShout_001_CarlConstruct_001">Ah, shit. This isn&apos;t right. I blacked out. Amy? Rogers?! Are you guys hearing this?! I could use some help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructVisible_1_001_CarlConstruct_001">What the hell happened to you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructVisible_2_001_CarlConstruct_001">What&apos;s wrong with your... everything? Did you go diving in a sewer or something?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructVisible_2_002_CarlConstruct_001">Hello, can you hear me? It&apos;s me Carl, calling from the floor, like right next to you.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_001_CarlConstruct_001">Do you need anything?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_002_CarlConstruct_001">If you didn&apos;t notice - I could use some help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_003_CarlConstruct_001">Are you lost or something?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_004_CarlConstruct_001">Mind giving a guy a hand?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_005_CarlConstruct_001">What the hell are you doing?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_2_001_Player_001">Are you human?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_2_002_CarlConstruct_001">Shit, did my body give it away? I try hard staying a mystery. Yeah, I&apos;m human. Are you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_2_003_Player_001">My name is Simon. Do you know anything about this place?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_2_004_CarlConstruct_001">Oh, you&apos;re new? That makes this slightly less weird. Look, I&apos;m obviously hurt. If you see anyone else around, just tell them where I am.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_3_001_Player_001">So, where are you exactly?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_3_002_CarlConstruct_001">Are you for real? I&apos;m right here. See me waving? Look at my hands. Hey, buddy.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_3_003_Player_001">Okay. I&apos;m just going to be - I&apos;m not seeing it. I see a machine, a robot talking.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_3_004_CarlConstruct_001">What the hell are you looking at - I&apos;m here. See?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_3_005_Player_001">Um, okay. I just didn&apos;t expect you to look like that.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_3_006_CarlConstruct_001">You&apos;re really hung up on appearances, you know that?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_EndOfSubjects_001_CarlConstruct_001">If you see any others, just let them know where I am.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_EndOfSubjects_002_CarlConstruct_001">I&apos;m really hurting here. My legs are killing me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_EndOfSubjects_003_CarlConstruct_001">Find someone who can help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_001_CarlConstruct_001">Stop! It hurts!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_002_CarlConstruct_001">Ah shit. Fuck.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_003_CarlConstruct_001">Stop, stop!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_004_CarlConstruct_001">Goddamit.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_005_CarlConstruct_001">For fucks sake.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_006_CarlConstruct_001">Don&apos;t. I can&apos;t take it.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_007_CarlConstruct_001">God-fucking-dammit.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_008_CarlConstruct_001">Please, don&apos;t.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_009_CarlConstruct_001">I can&apos;t take it. Please.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTorture_010_CarlConstruct_001">Please, stop.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_PostTorture_001_CarlConstruct_001">You -- help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_PostTorture_002_CarlConstruct_001">Please, tell Amy. I need help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_PostTorture_003_CarlConstruct_001">I&apos;m really hurt. </Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructSimonBack_PostTorture_004_CarlConstruct_001">I can&apos;t move, please.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_CarlConstructSimonLeaves_PostTorture_001_CarlConstruct_001">Please. Find help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_CarlConstructSimonLeaves_PostTorture_002_CarlConstruct_001">Don&apos;t let me die here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_CarlConstructSimonLeaves_PostTorture_003_CarlConstruct_001">Tell the others where I am.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_CarlConstructSimonLeaves_PostTorture_004_CarlConstruct_001">I really need help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_1_001_Player_001">What are you?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_1_002_CarlConstruct_001">Are you blind? It&apos;s me Carl. Carl Semken.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_1_003_Player_001">I don&apos;t understand what&apos;s happening.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_1_004_CarlConstruct_001">What&apos;s there to - I&apos;m hurt, okay? I need help. Get Holland over here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_1_005_Player_001">Who&apos;s Holland?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_1_006_CarlConstruct_001">The emergency guy. Tell Jonsy to call Omicron.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_2_001_Player_001">I&apos;m sorry, I think I pulled the wrong lever.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_2_002_CarlConstruct_001">Don&apos;t sweat it, just get me a doctor.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_3_001_Player_001">Wouldn&apos;t a mechanic make more sense?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_3_002_CarlConstruct_001">Are you trying to be fucking funny?! Get a medic!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_4_001_Player_001">But you&apos;re a robot.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_4_002_CarlConstruct_001">Really?! Do robots have legs, hands, a face? You&apos;re delusional.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_4_003_Player_001">Okay, calm down. I won&apos;t --</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_4_004_CarlConstruct_001">Get some fucking help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_001_CarlConstruct_001">(scream)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_002_CarlConstruct_001">(scream)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_003_CarlConstruct_001">(scream)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_004_CarlConstruct_001">(scream)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_005_CarlConstruct_001">(scream)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_006_CarlConstruct_001">(Sobbing)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_007_CarlConstruct_001">(Sobbing)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_008_CarlConstruct_001">(Sobbing)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_009_CarlConstruct_001">(Sobbing)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructBroken_010_CarlConstruct_001">(Sobbing)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4L_CarlConstructDrain_NoTorture_001_CarlConstruct_001">Please, don&apos;t -- I don&apos;t want to die.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4L_CarlConstructDrain_Tortured_001_CarlConstruct_001">What... what are you doing? Stop, stop, aargh!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomSite_Theta_001_Strasky_001">... there is something better ... here... it&apos;s here...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomSite_Omicron_001_Ross_001">Kill yourself. There&apos;s nothing left to live for.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_FlowControl_001_Player_001">Except for one. Think he said his name was Carl. He was okay. But I&apos;m pretty sure I accidentally killed him by turning off the power.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_FlowControl_002_Catherine_001">Oh, well. Robots don&apos;t really feel anything so.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_SuckedCarlPower_001_Player_001">Except for one. I... I killed him. I didn&apos;t mean to, really.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_SuckedCarlPower_002_Catherine_001">Well, try not to do that in the future. Even if it&apos;s just a robot, it might be useful.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_TorturedCarl_001_Player_001">Except for one. I think he was in pain. I&apos;m not sure what to do.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_TorturedCarl_002_Catherine_001">He said he was hurting?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_TorturedCarl_003_Player_001">Sort of.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_NoCarlMeeting_001_Catherine_001">This is all so strange.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomContact_CommRoomDialog_2_NoCarlMeeting_002_Player_001">You&apos;re telling me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SimonComments_WaterComment_001_Player_001">Shit shit shit. Where do I...? What should I...? Oh, fuck!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_1_001_Strasky_001">Jonsy. How&apos;s the evac coming along?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_1_002_Jonsdottir_001">We got everything we need to move, but we can&apos;t leave the plant without supervision.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_1_003_Jonsdottir_001">Adams decided to leave Amy Azzaro and Carl Semken to execute the automatization process.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_1_004_Strasky_001">And I bet they&apos;re thrilled about it.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_1_005_Jonsdottir_001">Anyway I just wanted to let you know we are on schedule and I&apos;ll talk to you tomorrow.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_1_006_Strasky_001">All right, I&apos;ll pass it on to Wolchezk.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_001_Strasky_001">Jonsy. Lovely morning for an evac, am I right?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_002_Jonsdottir_001">Yes, it will do. I wanted to introduce you to Amy and Carl. They&apos;ll be doing the talking as soon as I leave for Theta. Say hello.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_003_Carl_001">Hey, Theta!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_004_Amy_001">Hello!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_005_Strasky_001">Hey guys, I&apos;m Peter Strasky, dispatcher at Theta. Just let me know if there&apos;s anything I can do to help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_006_Jonsdottir_001">I suppose that&apos;s it. I&apos;ll see you real soon. When we arrive.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_2_007_Strasky_001">All right, Jonsy. Have a safe trip.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_3_001_Carl_001">Hey... hello... Theta?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_3_002_Strasky_001">Upsilon. What&apos;s up?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_3_003_Carl_001">We could use some direct contact with Heather... I mean site service engineer Wolchezk.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_3_004_Strasky_001">Direct links are almost impossible to establish. The LUMAR relays are basically junk at this point. You can send messages via the comm center and if you want I&apos;m pretty much always here - ready to relay anything by hand. I know it&apos;s a crap system, but it&apos;s all that works right now.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_3_005_Carl_001">All right, we just have to make do. Catch you later.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_001_Carl_001">Hello... Peter was it?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_002_Strasky_001">I&apos;m here. What&apos;s up?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_003_Carl_001">We&apos;re getting out. I just wanted to tell you that I&apos;m going to seal the comm center now, so this is definitely the last you&apos;ll hear from us. If we don&apos;t show up in the next couple of hours, send in the cavalry.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_004_Strasky_001">Hang on, what&apos;s happening? It&apos;s still the same plan, right? </Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_005_Carl_001">Yeah, we&apos;ll head for the shuttle and ride it directly to Theta.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_006_Strasky_001">Okay, good. I&apos;ll rally the troops for a welcome party.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CommRoomRecording_CommRoomRecording_4_007_Carl_001">That&apos;s what I like hear.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ControlRoomBody_2A_DetachTentacle_001_ControlRoomBody_001">No, don&apos;t.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_4_001_Player_001">How did you hurt yourself?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_4_002_CarlConstruct_001">Not sure. Blacked out pretty bad. Can&apos;t remember how I got here.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_4_003_Player_001">What do you remember then?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_4_004_CarlConstruct_001">I was in the pilot seat, remoting a UH -</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_4_005_Player_001">UH?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_4_006_CarlConstruct_001">A universal helper. You know a robot, like these things, but livelier. Anyway, I was just dealing with some heat shields. That&apos;s my last clear memory.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_5_001_Player_001">You were remote controlling a robot?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_5_002_CarlConstruct_001">Of course, we do it all the time. Robots are too unaware to do deal with some stuff. Intuition doesn&apos;t grow on motherboards, you know?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_5_003_Player_001">Could you maybe get trapped in the robot somehow?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_5_004_CarlConstruct_001">Your mind is pretty tightly wired to the helper, but nah. Pretty far-fetched.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_6_001_Player_001">I don&apos;t want to alarm you, but I think you might be trapped in a robot.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_6_002_CarlConstruct_001">I&apos;m telling you, get your eyes checked. I&apos;m right here. I see both my hands, both my feet. When you  remote, all you see is like a video feed from the helper unit. Your own body is entirely out of the picture.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_EndOfSubjects_001_CarlConstruct_001">Go tell the others.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_EndOfSubjects_002_CarlConstruct_001">Don&apos;t touch me.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructTalk_PostTorture_EndOfSubjects_003_CarlConstruct_001">Get me Holland.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_001_CarlConstruct_001">Why.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_002_CarlConstruct_001">I can&apos;t.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_003_CarlConstruct_001">Don&apos;t.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_004_CarlConstruct_001">Help.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_005_CarlConstruct_001">Not now.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_006_CarlConstruct_001">(sobs)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_007_CarlConstruct_001">(sobs)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_008_CarlConstruct_001">(sobs)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_009_CarlConstruct_001">(sobs)</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CarlConstruct_4E_CarlConstructDeathSob_010_CarlConstruct_001">(sobs)</Entry>
